  "body": "## Problem\n\nClippy 0.1.98 gives the `clippy::drop_non_drop` lint for `crates/app/tests/import_step_thread.rs:133`:\n\n```rust\ndrop(point);\n```\n\n`point` is a closure that borrows `ent` mutably. The closure has no `Drop` implementation, so `drop(point)` does nothing. The borrow ends at the last call of the closure.\n\nWith `-D warnings`, the clippy step of the gate is red on this toolchain.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Install the stable toolchain with clippy 0.1.98.\n2. Run `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --tests -- -D warnings`.\n3. Clippy gives `error: call to std::mem::drop with a value that does not implement Drop`.\n\n## Fix\n\nRemove the line `drop(point);`. The test does not change its behaviour.\n\nSuggested labels: `P5`, `effort:low`, `area:build`.\n",
